openbsm (21+ds3-1) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * New package auditd: auditd, audit, praudit, auditreduce and libauditd.
    The manual pages of the programs and of their files move from libbsm.
  * auditd ships /etc/security/audit_class, audit_control, audit_event,
    audit_user and audit_warn, and /var/audit for the trail.
  * auditd -l checks in its control port with init, in place of launchd.
    It needs init 2, which makes that port.
  * auditd recommends logger, which audit_warn calls.

